{"title": "Vengeful Guardian", "pageid": 6470, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Vengeful_Guardian", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Vengeful Guardian</b> is a passive feature of <a href=\"/wiki/Grym\" title=\"Grym\">Grym</a>, which causes it to always attack the last creature that struck it.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Grym always attacks the last creature that hit it if possible. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Prime_Target\"> Condition: Prime Target </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prime_Target_(Condition)\" title=\"Prime Target (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Prime_Target_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Prime_Target_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Prime_Target_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Prime_Target_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Prime_Target_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Prime_Target_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prime Target\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Prime_Target_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Prime_Target_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Prime_Target_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prime_Target_(Condition)\" title=\"Prime Target (Condition)\">Prime Target</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>You have drawn <a href=\"/wiki/Grym\" title=\"Grym\">Grym</a>'s ire.</li>\n<li>Grym will attempt to attack this creature if possible.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Grym\" title=\"Grym\">Grym</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200058\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 861/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6159/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1426/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 115/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 675676/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.765      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   32.765      1 -total\n 47.59%   15.594      1 Template:Condition\n 34.63%   11.346      1 Template:Condition_full/format\n 27.65%    9.059      1 Template:Icon_link\n 26.69%    8.744      1 Template:Icon_text\n 23.70%    7.765      4 Template:Trim\n 20.01%    6.557      1 Template:Ifempty\